<title>USA: Garden Botanika Nov same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Garden Botanika Nov same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garden Botanika Inc Wednesday said sales for the four-week fiscal period ended Nov. 30, increased 96 percent to $9.8 million from $5.0 million in November 1995. Same store sales rose 17 percent.</p>
<p>For the 10 months ended November 30, sales increased 73 percent to $61 million from $35.3 million in the comparable prior period. Year-to-date same store sales rose five percent.</p>
</text>
